01:12:05.333 --> 01:12:06.582
Apa?

01:12:06.583 --> 01:12:09.083
Sini. Jauhi jendela.

01:12:09.583 --> 01:12:11.292
Hei, kalian dengar itu?

01:12:13.833 --> 01:12:15.042
Hujannya berhenti.

01:12:58.625 --> 01:13:00.083
Lewiatan.

01:13:01.000 --> 01:13:01.958
Kraken.

01:13:07.167 --> 01:13:08.292
Putri duyung.

01:13:10.792 --> 01:13:12.416
Pikirkanlah, Ayah.

01:13:12.417 --> 01:13:15.750
Delapan puluh persen dasar laut
