01:19:53.750 --> 01:19:55.166
Harus kucoba!

01:19:55.167 --> 01:19:58.167
Cukup!

01:19:59.333 --> 01:20:01.042
- Kau harus…
- Tidak!

01:20:02.083 --> 01:20:03.292
Hentikan!

01:20:24.250 --> 01:20:25.625
