01:22:07.917 --> 01:22:08.958
Baiklah.

01:22:12.542 --> 01:22:13.417
Ayo.

01:22:22.083 --> 01:22:23.208
Aku siap.

01:22:39.792 --> 01:22:41.625
Ann, kau melihat sesuatu?

01:22:45.083 --> 01:22:45.917
